From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ROG HDR contributors <rog-hdr@invalid>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Version the filtered subtitle-renderer overlay query as
 rogdv11

---
 debian/changelog | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/debian/changelog b/debian/changelog
index 3ca5a3e..33731f7 100644
--- a/debian/changelog
+++ b/debian/changelog
@@ -1,3 +1,13 @@
+gst-plugins-bad1.0 (1.28.6-1ubuntu1+rogdv11) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium
+
+  * dvdspu, assrender, dvbsuboverlay: ask downstream about the overlay caps
+    with them as the filter, as textoverlay does, instead of intersecting an
+    unfiltered answer. A consumer whose accepted memory depends on stream
+    fields (the GTK Dolby mapper) answered unfiltered with identity memory
+    only, so subtitles on NVDEC-decoded Dolby video renegotiated forever.
+
+ -- ROG HDR contributors <rog-hdr@invalid>  Thu, 26 Nov 2026 20:00:00 +0000
+
 gst-plugins-bad1.0 (1.28.6-1ubuntu1+rogdv10) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium
 
   * Refresh paused subtitle selections at the current accurate stream position.
